            "type": "note",
            "text": "PyroVOL \u2014 Fire/Smoke Simulation\n\nNoiseVOL provides fuel source (injected each frame).\nPyroVOL runs combustion: fuel burns \u2192 heat rises \u2192 smoke produced.\nBuoyancy drives hot air upward, cooling decays temperature.\nVorticity adds turbulent swirl.\n\nOutputs: smoke density (port 0), temperature (port 1), velocity (port 2).\nRaymarchVOL renders the smoke density as a volume cloud.",
